			"Message": "chore(Sky): Rename product identifiers to fcd, restore README badges\n\nUpdate the server data folder name and Darwin bundle identifier in product.json from the legacy `fiddee` prefix to `fcd`, aligning with the current product branding. The README loses existing badges in its prior rewrite; restore the dark/light-themed GitHub badges table and replace the funding logos section with a proper HTML table using higher-quality NLnet and NGI0 Commons Fund SVG assets.\n\nAdditional formatting: rewrap long paragraphs and table rows at a consistent 80-100 character width throughout the README body for improved readability.",
			"SHA": "159c27d881350a9f2b4d1e40a95f0799783e7ae9"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
