				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				154,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Sky): Rewrite README with concise structure and consistent formatting\n\nReplace the verbose, HTML-heavy README with a clean markdown document organized into Overview, Architecture, Key Components, In the Land Project, Getting Started, API Reference, and Funding sections. Key improvements include:\n\n- Replace decorative HTML table headers and emoji spacers (U+2001) with simple markdown headings\n- Standardize Editor.Land domain casing across all links\n- Update the Mermaid diagram node labels to match new emoji (Sky ☀️, Wind 🌬️)\n- Convert the funding/logos HTML table to a concise markdown table with proper Asset-based SVG logos\n- Add formal NLnet NGI0 grant agreement number (No 101135429)\n- Remove verbose \"Interaction Flow\" walkthrough in favor of architectural summary\n- Simplify Getting Started section with clean markdown tables and compact examples\n\nThis makes the README more scannable, maintainable, and consistent with other Land project documentation.",
			"SHA": "d74a0ce3d28054666805c9ef4780f61d716645fc"
		},
